      "markdown": "# Still Water Physio: page plan\n\nOne page for Still Water Physio in Indiranagar. Every later part follows this document. Copy every name, price and time exactly as written here.\n\n## Section order\n\n| # | Section | Built by |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Hero | hero part |\n| 2 | Services | services part |\n| 3 | Opening hours | hours part |\n| 4 | Booking | booking part |\n| 5 | Questions people ask | questions part |\n\n## Hero\n\n- The clinic's name, Indiranagar, and one **Book on WhatsApp** button that links to the booking section.\n\n## Services\n\n- Sports injury rehab: Rs 1,200 a session\n- Back and neck care: Rs 1,000 a session\n- Home visits: Rs 1,800 a visit\n\n## Opening hours\n\nMonday to Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Sunday closed."
